## 6. Acceptance

- Every repository of the organization appears in this board or in the passing
  set of the fleet gate.
- The two sets are disjoint and their union is 256.
- The published catalog marks the 152 as `planned`.
- A repository leaves this board only when the fleet gate reports PASS on two
  consecutive runs and the parity gate reports no failing match case.

## 7. Maintenance

A repository is added to this board when it is created without an
implementation. A repository leaves this board when it earns PASS. The board
is regenerated by the fleet applier, which reads the upstream column and
writes the parity case table of every repository.
